   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving an assessment",
     "texto": [
      "**A/V-다고 보다** presents the speaker's assessment: adjective 좋다 → 좋**다고 봐요** (I consider it good); verb 버스가 늘어나다 → **늘어난다고 봐요** (I consider it will increase); noun 좋은 선택**이라고 봐요** (I consider it a good choice).",
      "It is not a literal quote: it shows how the speaker judges the proposition."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "An idea before a noun",
     "texto": [
      "To say «the idea / opinion / news that…», use **A-다는 N**, **V-ㄴ/는다는 N** and **N(이)라는 N**: 필요하다 → **필요하다는 의견** (opinion that it is necessary); 교통이 편리해지다 → **편리해진다는 의견** (opinion that transport will improve).",
      "The verb form depends on present or past; here the present and the expected future are shown."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
